    "en": {
      "trackName": "Keep on Running!",
      "description": "Keep on Running! is an endless runner built for Apple Watch. Dash through New York City traffic across three lanes, dodge cars, and jump over cones and barriers. Three lanes. One wrist.\n\nSwipe left or right, or turn the Digital Crown, to change lanes. Tap to jump. Speed gradually increases as your score grows. Collide with a car at low speed to hop on top and ride; crashes at higher speeds end your run. Your score keeps advancing while you run or ride.\n\nLower your wrist to pause and raise it to resume. Your high score is saved locally between sessions. Optional Game Center leaderboards and achievements give you more to aim for, but the core game is playable offline.\n\nJump in for a quick run, then try to beat your best. How far can you go?",
      "releaseNotes": "Added app and App Store translations for all 50 supported App Store locales.",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/keep-on-running/id6773387028?uo=4",
      "formattedPrice": "$0.99",
